t flip with q: sending comes out ahead no matter what I believe the other copy does, since the two inputs select different nodes. The only way out is to treat the inputs as the same up to renaming, which the essay's framing doesn't support. So I'll report that verdict and submit the letter.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Under A-FDT, the other copy's node stays fixed while I intervene on mine, so this is like the coordination case where the outcome depends on what I believe the other branch does. If that node is independent of mine, sending comes out ahead: with probability q the other sends, sending gives 4q, against 5 for staying quiet.\n\nUnder strict A-FDT the answer doesn't flip with q: sending comes out ahead no matter what I believe the other copy does, since the two inputs select different nodes. The only way out is to treat the inputs as the same up to renaming, which the essay's framing doesn't support. So I'll report that verdict and submit the letter.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10108,"completion_tokens":740,"total_tokens":10848,"cost":0.055232,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055232,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040432,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0148},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":301,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}